# =============================================================================
# ROOT .dockerignore
# =============================================================================
# This file is read by Docker for any build whose CONTEXT is the repo root.
# The only such build is the web-gateway image (web-gateway/Dockerfile), which
# needs just UI_WebApp/, shared/ (a path dependency of UI_WebApp) and
# web-gateway/. UI_App (QWallet) is excluded below — it ships as a mobile
# install only, never a web build (see web-gateway/Dockerfile for why).
# Everything listed here is kept OUT of the build context so the upload to
# the Docker daemon stays small and so VM-only runtime/secret material
# (crypto, wallets, .env) is never sent.
#
# NOTE: the per-component builds (offchain/, UI_App/, UI_WebApp/) use their own
# context directories and their own .dockerignore files — this root file does
# not affect them.
# =============================================================================

.git
.gitignore

# Not needed by the web build — and qchain-network holds crypto material and
# wallets on the VM, which must never enter a build context.
offchain
qchain-network
algo-benchmarking
assets
docs

# QWallet — mobile-only now, never built here.
UI_App

# Top-level docs / license (not copied into the image).
*.md
LICENSE

# Local Flutter build artifacts and caches — we build fresh inside the image.
UI_WebApp/build
UI_WebApp/.dart_tool

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
